1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,500
GLS：同意移交 ALS 自动程序。
GLS, go for ALS.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,260
好口令。火箭现在靠自己了。
Great call-out. The rocket is on its own.

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,860
四位勇敢的探索者，准备乘上
Four brave explorers, ready to ride

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:13,100
NASA 发射过的最强大的火箭。
the most powerful rocket NASA has ever launched.

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,000
约 10 天：绕过月球，再飞回来。
About ten days: around the Moon, and back.

6
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:20,000
消声水正在喷注。
Sound suppression water is flowing.

7
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,420
开始了。
And here we go.

8
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:26,460
十、九、八、七，
Ten, nine, eight, seven,

9
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:29,200
RS-25 发动机点火……
RS-25 engines lit…

10
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:34,100
四、三、二、一，助推器点火。
four, three, two, one, booster ignition.

11
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,300
升空。
And liftoff.

12
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:39,450
阿尔忒弥斯二号乘组，正飞向月球。
The crew of Artemis II, now bound for the Moon.

13
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,200
人类下一段伟大航程，就此开始。
Humanity’s next great voyage begins.

14
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:46,000
下一个节点：助推器分离，T+2 分 09 秒。
Next on the clock: booster separation, at two minutes nine.

15
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,700
滚转、俯仰正常。
Good roll, pitch.

16
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:53,700
收到，滚转、俯仰。
Roger, roll, pitch.

17
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:56,200
休斯敦现在接管 Integrity 号的飞行，
Houston, now controlling the flight of Integrity

18
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:59,500
执行阿尔忒弥斯二号绕月任务。
on the Artemis II mission around the Moon.
